{"id":"vod_zy360_73594","vodId":"73594","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"安妮·雪莉","name_cn":"安妮·雪莉","date":"2025-01-01","year":"2025","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全24集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20250621-1/8d4c7841e762c7e22622de6dfe07d591.jpg"},"summary":"住在爱德华王子岛艾凡里镇上的一对单身老兄妹马修·卡斯伯特和玛莉拉·卡斯伯特，原本打算领养一个男孩来帮忙农务，但领养中心却误送了一个女孩给他们，这个名叫安妮·雪莉的红发少女孤儿，满怀丰富的想像力并且能言善道，所有的自然景物在她的想象中，都变得能说话，有灵魂。原本发现弄错人的玛莉拉打算将安妮送回去，但马修却把安妮留了下来。安妮在挫折和嘲笑中总受到朋友戴安娜·贝利和家人的帮助，逐渐成长自我，自强自立……原著为《绿山墙的安妮》（英语：AnneofGreenGables，又译为清秀佳人、红发安妮）是一部由加拿大作家露西·莫德·蒙哥马利（LucyMaudMontgomery）所著的长篇小说，于1908年首度发表。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-09-27 23:11:12","episodeCount":24,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250424/9qnbFzFE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250505/xLLnEQ1S/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250506/U7DyYk0R/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250508/VaUJonvE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250508/YdXpdv3Z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250511/yNnxBUlV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250520/HIoZEqXM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250525/M4z2g9QX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250601/6d5AptT9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250608/Ie0GsDCa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250621/ZvXW7TXT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250621/KUkXfSEW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250628/YWZHrzDT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250705/cEtl8vG2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250712/Oneacs